1
00:00:00,683 --> 00:00:03,553
Bernie, I made a mess!

2
00:00:06,522 --> 00:00:09,692
(Dr Hofstadter:)I'm terribly sorry
that I upset your mother.

3
00:00:09,693 --> 00:00:11,523
(Sheldon:)Oh, it's all right.
She'll forgive you.

4
00:00:11,528 --> 00:00:14,668
(Sheldon:)She has to or
she goes to hell.

5
00:00:17,300 --> 00:00:18,970
(Dr Hofstadter:)I can't help but notice

6
00:00:18,969 --> 00:00:21,869
(Dr Hofstadter:)how her unconditional
love for you

7
00:00:21,872 --> 00:00:25,512
(Dr Hofstadter:)is diametrically opposed
to my own parenting strategies.

8
00:00:25,509 --> 00:00:28,479
(Sheldon:)Well, you doled
out affection

9
00:00:28,478 --> 00:00:31,218
(Sheldon:)as a reward for
achievement--

10
00:00:31,215 --> 00:00:33,515
(Sheldon:)a proven way to
raise a child.

11
00:00:33,517 --> 00:00:36,047
(Sheldon:)Or train a rat.

12
00:00:36,053 --> 00:00:37,953
(Dr Hofstadter:)But look how well
you turned out.

13
00:00:37,955 --> 00:00:42,455
(Sheldon:)I'd feign modesty at this point,
but who would believe me?

14
00:00:42,459 --> 00:00:44,159
(Sheldon:)Still, you need
to consider

15
00:00:44,161 --> 00:00:46,731
(Sheldon:)how successful Leonard's
brother and sister are.

16
00:00:46,730 --> 00:00:48,730
(Dr Hofstadter:)I suppose.

17
00:00:48,732 --> 00:00:52,832
(Sheldon:)While my brother and sister
are mouth-breathing idiots.

18
00:00:52,836 --> 00:00:55,806
(Dr Hofstadter:)Do you suppose
you would've flourished more

19
00:00:55,806 --> 00:00:57,306
(Dr Hofstadter:)in a reward-based environment?

